### Findings

- `apps/android-next` уже задаёт `versionCode = 1` и `versionName = "0.1.0"` в `defaultConfig`, а `buildFeatures.buildConfig = true` включён: `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:14`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:33`.
- Текущий путь версии: `MainActivity` передаёт только `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` в `AppShellScreen(appVersionName = ...)`: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`.
- `AppShellScreen` принимает `appVersionName: String` и прокидывает его только в drawer footer path как `versionName`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:121`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:214`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:220`.
- `DesignSettingsScreen` сейчас не принимает версию: его public signature содержит `selectedStyle`, `onStyleSelected`, `modifier`: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:48`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:49`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:50`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:51`.

### Components

- **MainActivity** — `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:24`  
  **Description**: создаёт `DefaultRootComponent` через Koin и рендерит `AppShellScreen` внутри `SchoolQuizTheme`: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:30`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:40`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`.  
  **Uses**: `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` и `BuildConfig.DEBUG`: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:44`.  
  **Data flow**: app BuildConfig → `AppShellScreen(appVersionName)`: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`.

- **AppShellScreen** — `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:121`  
  **Description**: root shell Composable wires drawer, scaffold, tabs and local settings content: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:102`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:208`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:227`.  
  **Uses**: receives `appVersionName: String`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123`.  
  **Used by**: `MainActivity`: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`; android test call site: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/androidTest/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/AppShellScreenTest.kt:256`.  
  **Data flow**: `appVersionName` → `DrawerContent(versionName)`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:220`.

- **DrawerContent** — `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt:25`  
