  **Preview call site**: `DesignSettingsScreenPreview`: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:300`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:302`.

### Data flow

- `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16` → app version code is configured as `1`.
- `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17` → app version name is configured as `"0.1.0"`.
- `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:33` → `BuildConfig` generation is enabled.
- `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43` → app layer reads `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME`.
- `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41` → app layer calls `AppShellScreen`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123` → app-shell public Composable accepts `appVersionName`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:220` → app-shell passes `appVersionName` to `DrawerContent(versionName)`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt:73` → drawer passes `versionName` to `DrawerFooter`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:74` → drawer renders `"v$versionName"`.
- `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:462` → settings screen is rendered without version inputs.

