### Constraints/Risks/Open Questions

- `AppShellScreen` docs explicitly state library modules cannot access `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` directly: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:107`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:108`.
- `AppShellScreen` docs explicitly state `isDebugBuild` is passed from app layer because library modules cannot access `BuildConfig` directly: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:109`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:110`.
- `DrawerFooter` comment records the same boundary for `versionName`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:35`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:36`.
- `android:feature:local:settings:presentation` is an Android library module with namespace `com.tpov.schoolquiz.android.feature.local.settings.presentation`, not the app module namespace: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/build.gradle.kts:1`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/build.gradle.kts:5`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/build.gradle.kts:6`.
- `android:feature:app-shell:presentation` depends on `android:feature:local:settings:presentation`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/build.gradle.kts:9`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/build.gradle.kts:11`.
- `apps/android-next` depends on `android:feature:app-shell:presentation`: `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:38`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:42`.
- Open question: whether app-shell API should add `appVersionCode` as a separate `Int`/`Long` parameter or pass already formatted footer text is not determined by current code; current public app-shell signature only has `appVersionName: String`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:121`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123`.
- Risk: settings layout is currently a full-screen `LazyColumn`; a footer implemented as another lazy item would be part of scroll content, while the spec requests bottom viewport anchoring: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:58`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:59`, `docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md:2`.

